ber\":6,\"name\":\"Time to Take 'Em Down\",\"overview\":\"The Cadets refocus on their routine. Meanwhile, Marshall struggles with more than just pressure, and the Blue Devils face issues that could impact their scores.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-02\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Who Came to Win?\",\"overview\":\"This is IT! It's DCI Finals weekend and the tension is on for The Blue Devils and The Cadets. How will the teams rank? Watch how the corps handle their last moments together and see who can take the pressure and who will break.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-09\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Take It. Own It. ROCK IT!\",\"overview\":\"Here it is. The last moments of battle for the DCI championship. Will The Blue Devils be back on top and secure another win? Will The Cadets rank higher and surprise everyone by coming out on top?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-16\",\"runtime\":30}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2016-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}